      "message": "we could get away with this as well with this. basically we are telling hose keeping subsystem that !active cpu can\u0027t be a house keeping cpu.\n\ndiff --git a/include/linux/sched/isolation.h b/include/linux/sched/isolation.h\nindex cc9f393..81c2487 100644\n--- a/include/linux/sched/isolation.h\n+++ b/include/linux/sched/isolation.h\n@@ -50,6 +50,9 @@ static inline void housekeeping_init(void) { }\n\n static inline bool housekeeping_cpu(int cpu, enum hk_flags flags)\n {\n+       if (!cpu_active)\n+               return false;\n+\n #ifdef CONFIG_CPU_ISOLATION\n        if (static_branch_unlikely(\u0026housekeeping_overridden))\n                return housekeeping_test_cpu(cpu, flags);",
      "range": {
