      "side": 1,
      "message": "Pavan, we\u0027ve been asked to not extend the solution beyond this file, and only address timers with this change.  The original solution (abandoned) was here: https://android-review.googlesource.com/c/kernel/common/+/1529260/\n\nIf there is a technical reason (like coverage we\u0027re not handling for timers) then I think we can propose an extension.  Thoughts?",
      "parentUuid": "72453783_a90e6348",
      "range": {
