      "writtenOn": "2020-12-17T20:57:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Pavan.  I agree it is probaly not possible that we won\u0027t find any online CPU, so lines 692 through 694 are redundant in the above version.  Thx.\n\nI want to incorporate your idea, but again, we\u0027ve been asked to not touch anything outside of core.c with this change.  I would like to keep it like that, so that ACK is more likely to accept it.  If you don\u0027t mind, I\u0027ll integrate your idea right into this code.  I\u0027ll have another version shortly, and then you can comment further.",
      "parentUuid": "12b9ef24_6c58cfaf",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 694,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 694,
        "endChar": 5
      },
      "revId": "30184496feb368d9738b86e9e705b9bbf080cadf",
